<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA CENTRAL BANK REFINANCING RISES TO 63.1 BLN LEVS.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA CENTRAL BANK REFINANCING RISES TO 63.1 BLN LEVS.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgarian National Bank's (BNB)</p>
<p>refinancing to commercial banks rose to 63.061 billion levs on</p>
<p>October 25 from 60.320 billion levs on October 18, BNB</p>
<p>preliminary figures showed.</p>
<p>  BNB refinancing, mln levs     OCT 25    OCT 18   SEPT 27</p>
<p>  Uncollaterlised deposits	 8,616    54,202    54,423</p>
<p>  Lombard loans			6,875     5,622     6,222</p>
<p>  Discount loans			   0	 389	 397</p>
<p>  Overdraft				107	 107	 107</p>
<p>  Overdue loans and deposits    47,463	  -	   -</p>
<p>  Total loans and deposits	63,061    60,320    61,149</p>
<p>  BNB treasury porfolio	   80,337    75,257    88,615</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
